  "details": "I would appreciate if vrchat can Extend the limit on accessories, instead of it being 5, how about 20-30 limit instead? since theres blocks and spheres, i've seen my friends do cool cosmetics with these accessories yet wanting to do more (as of detail, or more items)\n\nthough, i can list a first concern (of well, of who can have it) i would like to think of something: Visitors or new users can have the usual 5 Accessories (to prevent, well, i don't know, doing much?) known users should have 10-20 (15 seems well), and Trusted users should have 20-30 (25 seems well).\n\nof course, this is only an idea but i'd LOVE if this is implemented, and yes, you may configure the number / limit but hopefully it isn't below 20, thank you. :D\n\n(updated on August 24 26)",
